# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# This matters more than usual here: the project is maintained in two
# independent repositories (ADR-0006) whose content must be byte-identical at
# each milestone. Without normalisation, the tree hashes would diverge on a
# Windows checkout and the content-equality verification would be meaningless.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.duckdb binary
